{"title":"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first four terms of an arithmetic sequence are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/7/887203ae2a5566a5e9cb1e1004e272e273272f56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3p-q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/d/7ddd48d29cffa16ed411bc5af512994a0dfd8358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3p+q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />. What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dda3ff4bb1d82073aec197e361469fed00ef6b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010^\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> term of this sequence?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/167a0135ba0d2f295924cc8823881e6f957c2ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8041 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 8043 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 8045 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 8047 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8049$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/7/887203ae2a5566a5e9cb1e1004e272e273272f56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3p-q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/d/7ddd48d29cffa16ed411bc5af512994a0dfd8358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3p+q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> are consecutive terms, so the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a022cc72396f68e0fafc418444e0ea1bf15751c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3p+q)-(3p-q) = 2q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b05b52a00485a85933f7b6b5006ea13aff78d88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}p+2q &amp;= 9\\\\ 9+2q &amp;= 3p-q\\\\ q&amp;=2\\\\ p&amp;=5\\end{align*}\" width=\"123\" height=\"91\" />\n</p><p>The common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dda3ff4bb1d82073aec197e361469fed00ef6b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010^\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> term is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9cc4cffb29eceab27e0e2bdaabebbbf4992345b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5+4(2009) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }8041}\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since all the answer choices are around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/991c128f326a51cc6931634891f6fc2a1455ff1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010 \\cdot 4 = 8040$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"118\" height=\"13\" />, the common difference must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The first term is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/3/333757668d52e09ec9241dc3c22f498933af63e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 4 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dda3ff4bb1d82073aec197e361469fed00ef6b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010^\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/9/519a1c0201fb48fde82827472809097561734c2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 4 \\cdot 2009 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }8041}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"198\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3gsf_XbOhhY\">https://youtu.be/3gsf_XbOhhY</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A\">2010 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-